  "final_answer": "I found the perfect recipe. Let me provide the complete answer.\n\n# Vegetarian Four Cheese Lasagna\n\n**Source:** https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/170468/vegetarian-four-cheese-lasagna/\n\n## Recipe Matches All Criteria:\n- ✅ **Vegetarian** (no meat)\n- ✅ **170 Reviews** (more than 100)\n- ✅ **4.6 Stars** (at least 4.5)\n- ✅ **Yields 8 Servings** (suitable for 6 people, with leftovers)\n\n## Ingredients:\n- 2 cups peeled and diced pumpkin\n- 1 eggplant, sliced into 1/2 inch rounds\n- 5 tomatoes\n- 1 pint ricotta cheese\n- 9 ounces crumbled feta cheese\n- ⅔ cup pesto\n- 2 eggs, beaten\n- Salt and pepper to taste\n- 1 (15 ounce) can tomato sauce\n- Fresh pasta sheets\n- 1 ⅓ cups shredded mozzarella cheese\n- 1 cup grated Parmesan cheese\n\n## Directions:\n1. **Preheat oven** to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).\n2. **Roast the vegetables:** Place pumpkin on a baking sheet and roast in the oven until browned and tender, about 30 minutes. Meanwhile, grill the eggplant on a charcoal grill or fry in a skillet, turning once, until charred and tender, 10 to 15 minutes. Halve tomatoes and place on a baking sheet in the oven for the last 15 minutes of pumpkin time; cook until tender and wrinkly.\n3. **Make the cheese mixture:** In a medium bowl, stir together ricotta, feta, pesto, eggs, salt and pepper until well mixed. Fold roasted pumpkin into the ricotta mixture.\n4. **Assemble the lasagna:** Spoon half of the tomato sauce into a 9x13 baking dish. Lay two pasta sheets over the sauce. Arrange a single layer of eggplant slices over the pasta and top with half the ricotta mixture. Cover with two more pasta sheets. Arrange the roasted tomatoes evenly over the sheets and spoon the remaining half of the ricotta mixture over the tomatoes. Sprinkle with half the mozzarella. Top with the remaining two sheets of pasta. Pour remaining tomato sauce over all and sprinkle with remaining mozzarella and Parmesan.\n5. **Bake:** Bake in the preheated oven for 30 to 40 minutes, until golden brown and bubbly.\n\nThis recipe is a flavorful vegetarian lasagna featuring a unique combination of roasted pumpkin, eggplant, and tomatoes layered with a four-cheese mixture (ricotta, feta, mozzarella, and Parmesan) infused with pesto — a satisfying dish suitable for serving 6 or more people.",
